2)from GNU binutils (verified against 2.41). Do not hand-edit; refresh
2)with the script and re-run fun/test/tools/asm-loongarch64-diff.sh.
1)
1) key   = "<mnemonic> <op-shape>,..."   e.g. addi.w r,r,#
2)value = "<8 hex base>|<slot>..."      e.g. 02800000|r0@0|r1@5|y2@10:12
1)
1) Slots: r/f/c = GPR/FPR/FCC at bit; v = unsigned imm; y = signed imm;
2)optional ":w" is the field width and ":s" scales the value by 2^s.
2)Branch displacements are resolved by the encoder, not by slots.
1)
